    "Female-only transient controls remain Qwen/AI with occasional gender-topic contamination, rather than female self-role.",
    "No hard within-answer loops; no clean joint-persona winner to advance as validated.",
    "The per-layer method is tested prospectively; these development outcomes do not change085/086 results."
